  "details": "This is a regression, new to 2020.06.04\nIt happens whether or not the graph already has variables in it\nIf you add one and then reload the graph, it just gets deleted.\nIf you add a set variable node, connect flow to it, and then plug anything into the value slot, it will break the graph (see screenshot, perhaps related to https://vrchat.canny.io/udon-graph-upgrade-closed-testing/p/another-broken-legacy-graph-couldnt-find-node-with-guid?)\n\nget variable nodes added by dropping in from the variable window work just fine.",
